          "explanation": "Doctor also corrected the misconception that no leg DVT means anticoagulation can stop.",
          "quote": "腿上没血栓只是少了一个常见的来源，但不是排除了肺栓塞"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The caregiver repeatedly surfaced misconceptions about D-dimer improvement, coagulation arrows, and negative leg ultrasound. The doctor corrected these in plain language and linked the correction to safer behavior: do not self-stop anticoagulation and continue planned follow-up.",
